## How it was tested

On upstream `main` 829b9477d + this branch (dev build, Docker, upstream's `./gradlew`): `mergePluginGamevals` + `buildCache`, compile, `:content:quest:test` pass (the goblin-village module has no tests), `spotlessCheck` pass, `installDist`, and the server boots to "Server ready" (the startup check against the quest dbrow passes). `tools/scripts/fix_gameval_conflicts.py --check`: no conflicts (no gamevals added).

Not yet checked in game from this exact branch; an earlier version of the same script runs on our own test server.

No unit tests: the earlier version's dialogue tests needed a separate test fixture, and as with #366 they are left out. The item moves are one `invTransaction` each (dye, mix) or a single add / delete checked before any state changes (crate, hand-in).

